# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Everything here is deliberately NOT published. The value of this repository is
# the scripts; the captures and bundles they produce are large, machine-specific,
# and contain registry exports, account names and certificate thumbprints.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Capture output and comparison reports
NdesCapture-AD/
NdesCapture-NDES/
working-backups/
automated-backups/
softwareCheck/

# Migration bundles and logs
NDESMigration/
NDESMigration-latest/
**/ndes-config.json
**/ndesmigration-*.log

# The capture kit's own lab notes (sanitised copies live in docs/)
AD-CA.txt
AD-NDES.txt
CA.txt
NDES.txt
servernames.txt

# Third-party tooling: openssl and sscep are not redistributable, and the file
# named "download" is Microsoft's mscep.dll captured from a server.
scep/
download

# Secrets and key material - never commit these
password.txt
*.pfx
*.pvk
*.key
*.secret

# Archives and noise
*.zip
*.7z
.vscode/
*.tmp
Thumbs.db
